                                "sense_id": "737c3dc4-7cb9-32e4-8fff-0b424b36ed8e",
                                "text": "The news came on. There was relative calm in the world that night. Channel Nine had a convenience-store stickup in Lakewood, an environmental protest in Fort Collins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de5a7487-bd07-44c7-bbf0-35dbe8cdf67d",
                                "sense_id": "737c3dc4-7cb9-32e4-8fff-0b424b36ed8e",
                                "text": "One night, Sylvio talked about why drug dealers resist drug robbers during a stickup."
